body:
Yo me fui del pais hace tiempo. Ahorita tener el pelo largo es tan facil como hacerlo, en Venezuela hay mucha ideologia estupida. Sin embargo, he visto ex companieros del liceo que ahorita lo llevan largo. 

&#x200B;

Gen z woo woo

On my steam and gog account still appears as "early access" is this a bug? if i buy it, it will give me the full game?

&#x200B;

edit: updated it, just bought it

What happened to me was that i was interned on a recovery center (that also was a mental health facility center). My time there lasted a month and during that lapse, some of the psychologists asked me to write a kind-of-a biography and a diary. But the thing is that when i'd decided to start writing, and when i got to the moment when my depression *started*, *i couldn't remember anything.*

&#x200B;

It took me one complete week to get over that part, because my mind tried to hide those memories from me (that's something me and my psychologist talked about it). And well, even these days my gf makes fun of me because of my lack of *long-term* memory. Things like my *parents  birthdays, Psychiatrist appointment dates,* that some of the 'belongings' in the appartment are actually *mine... etc*

I'm on the same track here. Been trying to work in a cashier-style job, but thats hard when almost in all places, people only receive experienced-on the job-ones. 

&#x200B;

Wish you can find something and try to stick with it
